    "body": "This was an issue for a while, but https://github.com/w3c/webdriver/issues/350 has been resolved and WebDriver is the recommended way to do such automated testing. E.g., https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/#get-element-shadow-root.\r\n\r\nIf you're interested in reading more about the rationale behind closed shadow roots I wrote up https://annevankesteren.nl/2019/10/encapsulation-theory a while back summarizing some of the discussion on that front.",
